flowchart TD
    SRC[Books / URLs / text] --> EX[Extract text, page locations and figures]
    EX --> PREP[Code + Jev: structural recovery]
    PREP --> READ[Codex: source reading and concept discovery]
    READ --> DIM[Codex: dimensions and internal reading tasks]
    DIM --> ANN[Jev: source passage annotations]
    ANN --> IDX[Persistent source-linked index]
    IDX --> V[Vertical evidence: argument dependencies]
    IDX --> H[Horizontal evidence: comparisons and conflicts]
    V --> PACK[Code + Jev: exact-span evidence packets]
    H --> PACK
    PACK --> WRITE[Codex: illustrated articles and hub links]
    WRITE --> CHECK[Provenance, quality checks and revision feedback]
    CHECK --> DIM
    CHECK --> GIT[Authorized commit and push]
